{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107126","id":2568351552,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ZFe9A","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107126","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107126.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107126.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107126","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107126/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107126/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107126/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/132c9e5ce2a070501e74d31b8ae39eeb6a514d7a","number":107126,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Expose fuzzy search api to scripting","user":{"login":"a-johnston","id":9058941,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTg5NDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9058941?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston","html_url":"https://github.com/a-johnston","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12502\r\n\r\nThis additionally makes scoring cutoff parameters configurable and fixes a very minor bug in one of the score tie-breakers. The \"automatic\" case sensitivity used by the quick open search has been moved to that call site and the query now gets passed directly to the search methods so the dirty token state handling is removed entirely. \r\n\r\nOpen questions\r\n- Should the classes added to the API be marked as experimental?\r\n- How many scoring/filtering knobs be exposed? The existing options are pretty minimal, the PR adds filtering options, but should more things be exposed eg `boundary_chars` or scoring weights?\r\n\r\nExample usage: (also tested with c#)\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar items := [\"Potion of Healing\", \"Greater Health Potion\", \"Poison Vial\"]\r\nvar fuzzy := FuzzySearch.new()\r\n\r\nfor result in fuzzy.search_all(\"health potion\", items):\r\n\tprint(result.target)\r\n```\r\nproduces the output:\r\n```\r\nGreater Health Potion\r\nPotion of Healing\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rep